                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0e702f56-d023-39c0-9321-9eb07b7b1bd9",
                                        "entry_id": "49afe872-b918-3e0a-ae1e-894241d3bac1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Not compulsory; left to personal choice; elective."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8c66aace-ca99-4d23-9874-f2da3f9f2cf9",
                                                "sense_id": "0e702f56-d023-39c0-9321-9eb07b7b1bd9",
                                                "text": "On that beach clothing is entirely optional."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f5ccf78b-0cfa-4e33-9d81-7d1c7218fecd",
                                                "sense_id": "0e702f56-d023-39c0-9321-9eb07b7b1bd9",
                                                "text": "Do you need to wear eyeliner? As with any makeup step, eyeliner is completely optional. From an artistic perspective, if you are wearing eyeshadow, I almost always recommend wearing eyeliner, unless your eyelids and eyelashes are obscured by the eyebrow area. Eyeliner is a basic part of an eye-makeup design because it shapes and defines the eyes and makes the eyelashes look thicker."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "optional",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e4ca27b6-0b8e-3361-8ea0-f42467c99526",
                                        "entry_id": "ea977a66-f998-3960-9fbf-ed23334f79a2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Something that is not compulsory, especially part of an academic course."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7b63bf3f-63fb-33fe-9818-be716f115c99",
                                        "entry_id": "ea977a66-f998-3960-9fbf-ed23334f79a2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In various programming languages, a kind of variable that is assigned a specific data type but may or may not hold an actual value."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "capitalized",
                                            "sometimes"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0bb3a521-9c51-4a7a-b6d3-7222d8f07e64",
                                                "sense_id": "7b63bf3f-63fb-33fe-9818-be716f115c99",
                                                "text": "In functional languages, there is a data type called the option type, also called the maybe type. Its purpose is to encapsulate a value, which is returned from a function. […] In Java 8, the Optional class has been added to serve as an option type."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1d88afa2-22cb-4c66-a6e7-221ab5e8aae9",
                        "source_entry_id": "00be43a1-75ac-33fa-89e6-cd6cc32fd107",
                        "source_sense_id": "6d982255-2d82-3c47-91ce-464b12212bbe",
